<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f64346f67ed2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The European Commission last month asked Microsoft, TikTok, LinkedIn, Google, Snap, Meta and X to take part in a stress test, to make sure they have appropriate risk mitigation measures in place." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4452" .

